    {
        "content": "<p>I'm having a look through the downstream packages of KA, but nothing's jumping out at me so far:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Julia console\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"go\">pkg&gt; why KernelAbstractions</span>\n<span class=\"go\">  KernelAbstractions</span>\n<span class=\"go\">  ├─← CUDACore</span>\n<span class=\"go\">  │   ├─← CUDA</span>\n<span class=\"go\">  │   ├─← CUDATools</span>\n<span class=\"go\">  │   │   └─← CUDA</span>\n<span class=\"go\">  │   ├─← CUPTI</span>\n<span class=\"go\">  │   │   └─← CUDATools (*)</span>\n<span class=\"go\">  │   ├─← NVML</span>\n<span class=\"go\">  │   │   └─← CUDATools (*)</span>\n<span class=\"go\">  │   ├─← cuBLAS</span>\n<span class=\"go\">  │   │   ├─← CUDA</span>\n<span class=\"go\">  │   │   └─← cuSOLVER</span>\n<span class=\"go\">  │   │       └─← CUDA</span>\n<span class=\"go\">  │   ├─← cuFFT</span>\n<span class=\"go\">  │   │   └─← CUDA</span>\n<span class=\"go\">  │   ├─← cuRAND</span>\n<span class=\"go\">  │   │   └─← CUDA</span>\n<span class=\"go\">  │   ├─← cuSOLVER (*)</span>\n<span class=\"go\">  │   └─← cuSPARSE</span>\n<span class=\"go\">  │       ├─← CUDA</span>\n<span class=\"go\">  │       └─← cuSOLVER (*)</span>\n<span class=\"go\">  ├─← GPUArrays</span>\n<span class=\"go\">  │   ├─← CUDACore (*)</span>\n<span class=\"go\">  │   ├─← cuBLAS (*)</span>\n<span class=\"go\">  │   └─← cuSPARSE (*)</span>\n<span class=\"go\">  └─← cuSPARSE (*)</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
        "id": 640740785,
        "sender_full_name": "James Wrigley",
        "timestamp": 1794835641
